English summary (the German text above is binding):
Free for the Kodi community, but not open source. You may use and link to
the tool, and publish the addons and skins you build with it. Without
written permission you may not sell, rent or charge for it, add
advertising, host or mirror it elsewhere, distribute modified versions, or
remove copyright notices. Estuary-based skins stay under Estuary's free
licenses; bundled third-party addons keep their own licenses. Use at your
own risk, no warranty.
